Description: Evaluates likelihood ratio tests for alleged ancestry. Implements the methods of Tvedebrink et al (2018) <doi:10.1016/j.tpb.2017.12.004> and Tvedebrink and Eriksen <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.fsigen.2019.06.013>.
